                                                "sense_id": "303d8cbf-e131-3215-b082-22052890419a",
                                                "text": "I built a wall between myself and the bullies."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d3141edc-a7ca-3bfc-8423-56852a891a64",
                                        "entry_id": "0d21ae57-bb4a-33e7-ad4d-a7c4a950734b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One of the vertical sides of a container."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e8bc79ac-9eb3-4a10-a725-eff1e57c4235",
                                                "sense_id": "d3141edc-a7ca-3bfc-8423-56852a891a64",
                                                "text": "The extraordinary thinness of the walls of these vases, which reminds us of the finest china, or even of Venetian glass"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1f89e771-8d9f-3842-8817-ed1544b6d0f1",
                                        "entry_id": "0d21ae57-bb4a-33e7-ad4d-a7c4a950734b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A dividing or containing structure in an organ or cavity."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a6959d14-8104-480d-997a-7a99d5fb1193",
                                                "sense_id": "1f89e771-8d9f-3842-8817-ed1544b6d0f1",
                                                "text": "There is definitely some sort of lump on the back wall of my throat (right side)."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ead68eeb-c11b-4558-bf1a-f6c8d0aef90a",
                                                "sense_id": "1f89e771-8d9f-3842-8817-ed1544b6d0f1",
                                                "text": "The epidermal cells of the capsule wall of Jubulopsis, with nodose \"trigones\" at the angles, are very reminiscent of what one finds in Frullania spp."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "27b471db-f96e-3ee3-ae2a-db25aa6fd266",
                                        "entry_id": "0d21ae57-bb4a-33e7-ad4d-a7c4a950734b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A fictional bidder used to increase the price at an auction."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cabc676d-ab54-3dce-ae00-91a8fee27061",
                                        "entry_id": "0d21ae57-bb4a-33e7-ad4d-a7c4a950734b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A doctor who tries to admit as few patients as possible."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "US",
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5f9398c2-9782-3b00-a51d-fb92e81d2c2a",
                                        "entry_id": "0d21ae57-bb4a-33e7-ad4d-a7c4a950734b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A line of defenders set up between an opposing free-kick taker and the goal."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c31e521a-76bd-442d-9dca-f5359243e265",
                                                "sense_id": "5f9398c2-9782-3b00-a51d-fb92e81d2c2a",
                                                "text": "Blackburn were the recipients of another dose of fortune when from another Thomas pass Odemwingie was brought down by Jones inside the penalty area, but referee Mark Clattenburg awarded a free-kick which Chris Brunt slammed into the wall."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f1d774f3-3c46-37f1-bcea-fe7c125718ee",
                                        "entry_id": "0d21ae57-bb4a-33e7-ad4d-a7c4a950734b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Two or more blockers skating together so as to impede the opposing team."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b68369cc-c226-42a4-abbb-aceba75f730e",
                                                "sense_id": "f1d774f3-3c46-37f1-bcea-fe7c125718ee",
                                                "text": "It can also be used to maintain the presence of a wall when one of the blockers who makes up the wall is picked off by an opposing blocker attempting to shut down the wall."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8f09aec5-bc1d-3fe4-a9f1-7f4b8956d6ef",
                                        "entry_id": "0d21ae57-bb4a-33e7-ad4d-a7c4a950734b",
