                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Face-down tiles arranged in stacked rows from which players draw new tiles."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fa20e6ca-7326-3235-ab24-3146ffcc5cce",
                                        "entry_id": "0d21ae57-bb4a-33e7-ad4d-a7c4a950734b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The stage of biological aging where physical appearance and attractiveness start to deteriorate rapidly."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "definite",
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3ac22375-2ed5-4937-9ec5-13b977a74902",
                                                "sense_id": "fa20e6ca-7326-3235-ab24-3146ffcc5cce",
                                                "text": "Depreciation of assets happens. Prepare yourself\nMarla. Get ready for the wall."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9eea9c15-ea72-4b08-84a0-cf86faa857d1",
                                                "sense_id": "fa20e6ca-7326-3235-ab24-3146ffcc5cce",
                                                "text": "At what age would you peg the\n'wall' to be for men, on or thereabouts?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "602ba3e5-1cf6-423b-a70d-7784ed708b7b",
                                                "sense_id": "fa20e6ca-7326-3235-ab24-3146ffcc5cce",
                                                "text": "I have never had a problem getting the attention of men. I'm 44\nand there's no wall staring me in the face"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b2cbba8a-94a2-44db-a432-64b33814b509",
                                                "sense_id": "fa20e6ca-7326-3235-ab24-3146ffcc5cce",
                                                "text": "That was only six\nyears later and Natasha is not near the wall yet"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f78b510b-12e0-44b3-84ab-11d1615a4266",
                                                "sense_id": "fa20e6ca-7326-3235-ab24-3146ffcc5cce",
                                                "text": "As for the wall....Im convinced part of this is just something us guys tell ourselves to 'get back'(in our minds) at all the girls who wouldn't sleep with us 5-10 years ago"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "384729aa-bace-3367-8f98-a48dea412609",
                                        "entry_id": "0d21ae57-bb4a-33e7-ad4d-a7c4a950734b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The right or privilege of taking the side of the road near the wall when encountering another pedestrian; said to be taken or given."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "historical"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2808064e-a3a2-4b89-b164-56d17f668413",
                                                "sense_id": "384729aa-bace-3367-8f98-a48dea412609",
                                                "text": "He related to me the following minute anecdote of this period: 'In the last age, when my mother lived in London, there were two sets of people, those who gave the wall, and those who took it; the peaceable and the quarrelsome. […] Now it is fixed that every man keeps to the right; or, if one is taking the wall, another yields it; and it is never a dispute.'"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d0620b39-9220-4557-bb30-e02283207a5e",
                                                "sense_id": "384729aa-bace-3367-8f98-a48dea412609",
                                                "text": "All persons, in walking the streets, whose right sides are next the wall, are intitled to take the wall."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "084e1dda-0397-40de-b47d-f8c4be0f195f",
                                                "sense_id": "384729aa-bace-3367-8f98-a48dea412609",
                                                "text": "Taking the wall thus was also a social distinction. An entire episode in the second book is therefore dedicated “to whom to give the wall” and “to whom to refuse the wall” (II. 4564)."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9dfd8830-a573-3329-a700-98c0f527679c",
                                        "entry_id": "0d21ae57-bb4a-33e7-ad4d-a7c4a950734b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A very steep slope."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
